      "text": "2. Hashing algorithms\n    - MD5 , SHA1\n    - Encrypt the longURL using md5, sha1-> {shortURL: first(6 or 7)} -> store in DB -> 201 created response\n    - but, first 6,7 chars can be duplicate\n\n3. Generate ID using base62",
