      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "7. Optimizations:\n    - GET /url/{shortURL} -- READ operation in DB was costly -- introduce cache (redis)",
