      "updated": 1786555961848,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- (Horizontal scaling)Microservices - split some actions/responsibilities in separate servers/services\n    - Encryption server - used to only generate shortURL and store it. -- user uages about 20%\n    - Decryption server - used to get the longURL from shortURL from DB/cache -- users usage about 80%\n    - add Load Balancer to manage the traffic of requests to servers\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- (Horizontal scaling)Microservices - split some actions/responsibilities in separate servers/services\n    - Encryption server - used to only generate shortURL and store it. -- user uages about 20%\n    - Decryption server - used to get the longURL from shortURL from DB/cache -- users usage about 80%\n    - add Load Balancer to manage the traffic of requests to servers\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
