    {
      "id": "rj-ekoDwnn35VcEqJgn1i",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -990.6805467424065,
      "y": 1470.6517159521682,
      "width": 937.7794189453125,
      "height": 825,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "UV22Gwbtmj2LurNOuRHrk",
        "q-UXA0hNlOHlTC5tg86-2"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1I",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 721636724,
      "version": 538,
      "versionNonce": 406839116,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786556515929,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Phase 1 — RAG fundamentals\n\nRAG → embeddings → chunking → vector DB → retrieval → Top-K → reranking → hybrid search\n\n↓\n\nPhase 2 — LLM application\n\nPrompting → context → structured output → hallucination → guardrails → evaluation\n\n↓\n\nPhase 3 — Agents\n\nTool calling → agent loop → state → LangChain → LangGraph\n\n↓\n\nPhase 4 — MCP\n\nMCP → client/server → tools/resources → MCP vs REST → security → production\n\n↓\n\nPhase 5 — Production\n\nRetries → timeouts → observability → evaluation → cost → latency → prompt injection\n\n↓\n\nPhase 6 — Your project\n\nDB2 AI Assistant architecture → decisions → failures → trade-offs → improvements",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Phase 1 — RAG fundamentals\n\nRAG → embeddings → chunking → vector DB → retrieval → Top-K → reranking → hybrid search\n\n↓\n\nPhase 2 — LLM application\n\nPrompting → context → structured output → hallucination → guardrails → evaluation\n\n↓\n\nPhase 3 — Agents\n\nTool calling → agent loop → state → LangChain → LangGraph\n\n↓\n\nPhase 4 — MCP\n\nMCP → client/server → tools/resources → MCP vs REST → security → production\n\n↓\n\nPhase 5 — Production\n\nRetries → timeouts → observability → evaluation → cost → latency → prompt injection\n\n↓\n\nPhase 6 — Your project\n\nDB2 AI Assistant architecture → decisions → failures → trade-offs → improvements",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
